<title>USA: TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EVERT CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from</p>
<p>the $1.25 million Evert Cup women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>4-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 6-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 6-2</p>
<p>6-1</p>
